sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Frontend as ORISO Frontend/Admin
  participant Keycloak as Keycloak online-beratung
  participant Backend as ORISO Backend Service
  User->>Frontend: Open application
  Frontend->>Keycloak: Redirect to app client login
  Keycloak->>Keycloak: Browser flow and forms flow
  Keycloak-->>Frontend: Authorization result and tokens
  Frontend->>Backend: API request with Bearer access token
  Backend->>Keycloak: Fetch JWKs when cache misses
  Backend->>Backend: Validate issuer, signature, roles, tenantId
  Backend-->>Frontend: Authorized response
